  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程統計",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING STATISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將統計概念以實用的角度深入淺出予以介紹的入門課程。不過分強調古典機率理論與艱深數學理論，聚焦統計思考的要素，融合實際資料與觀念，使學者能鞏固基本與正確之統計概念，以便落實至工程領域之應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is an introductory course that introduces statistical concepts from a practical perspective. It does not overemphasize classical probability theory and difficult mathematical theories, but does focus on the elements of statistical thinking and integrate actual data and concepts, so that learners can consolidate basic and correct statistical concepts for application in the engineering field.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
